{"name": "Alter Branching Aspect", "type": "restAction", "system": {"origin": {"type": "Race", "name": "Elkanth Aspirant"}, "restType": "short", "requirements": "None", "summary": "Reassign the attribute bonus granted by your Branching Aspect.", "description": {"value": "<p>As a <em>Rest Action</em>, you can focus the magic in your body to slightly alter your form, allowing you to remove the attribute bonus granted by&nbsp;@Compendium[undertaking-homebrew.abilities.Q78C6Z5AKLUHOP26]{Branching Aspects} and reassign it to a different attribute.</p>", "chat": "", "unidentified": ""}, "source": ""}, "_id": "YCYYZ4X8PA6KSF26", "_stats": {"systemId": "undertaking", "systemVersion": "1.0.0", "coreVersion": "11.304"}}
{"name": "Alter Rooted Aspect", "type": "restAction", "system": {"origin": {"type": "Race", "name": "Elkanth Null Morph"}, "restType": "long", "requirements": "None", "summary": "Reassign the attribute bonus granted by your Rooted Aspect.", "description": {"value": "<p>As a <em>Long Rest Action</em>, you can focus the magic in your body to slightly alter your form, allowing you to remove the attribute bonus granted by&nbsp;@Compendium[undertaking-homebrew.abilities.Q78C6Z5AKLUHOP26]{Branching Aspects} and reassign it to a different attribute.</p>", "chat": "", "unidentified": ""}, "source": ""}, "_id": "DDSB3DNVPUQO2F8R", "_stats": {"systemId": "undertaking", "systemVersion": "1.0.0", "coreVersion": "11.304"}}
{"name": "Prepare New Material", "type": "restAction", "system": {"origin": {"type": "Class", "name": "Bard"}, "restType": "long", "requirements": "None", "summary": "Replace a Bard cantrip or two Bard spells.", "description": {"value": "<p>As a <em>Long Rest Action</em>, you can choose to either replace one Bard cantrip you know with a different cantrip from the Bard spell list, or replace two Bard spells you know with two other spells from the Bard spell list that are of a level you can cast.</p>", "chat": "", "unidentified": ""}, "source": ""}, "_id": "AZTVZVCUEPFQB5RN", "_stats": {"systemId": "undertaking", "systemVersion": "1.0.0", "coreVersion": "11.304"}}
